  "quest.23C1566E5ACD3D87.title": "First Basic Factory",
  "quest.23C1566E5ACD3D87.quest_subtitle": "Right-click the Enrichment Chamber with a Basic Tier Installer to create the Basic Enriching Factory. The installer is consumed while Mekanism preserves the machine inventory, energy, upgrades, side configuration, ownership, and security data. Direct Factory recipes are disabled; Energy Cube upgrades remain on their separate managed ladder.",
  "quest.23C1566E5ACD3D87.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click the Enrichment Chamber with a Basic Tier Installer to create the Basic Enriching Factory. The installer is consumed while Mekanism preserves the machine inventory, energy, upgrades, side configuration, ownership, and security data. Direct Factory recipes are disabled; Energy Cube upgrades remain on their separate managed ladder.",
