    "Carry one local logistics family from its Basic batch through the installed physical upgrade ladder.",
    "This is a non-consuming observation task: keep the hardware in your factory; the recipe and machine chain remain the only progression authority."
  ],
  "quest.205F1E5DF1C94912.title": "Induction Matrix Hardware",
  "quest.205F1E5DF1C94912.quest_subtitle": "Assemble and actually connect an induction matrix; tasks observe its tangible shell and ultimate internal hardware.",
  "quest.205F1E5DF1C94912.quest_desc": [
